o tumor vascularity in human breast cancer.</article-title><source>Cancer Res</source><year>1993</year><volume>53</volume><fpage>4161</fpage><lpage>4163</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">7689928</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B24"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><collab>Vartanian RK</collab><name><surname>N.</surname><given-names>W</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Correlation of intratumoral endothelial cell proliferation with microvessel density (tumor angiogenesis) and tumor cell proliferation in breast carcinoma.</article-title><source>Am J Pathol</source><year>1994</year><volume>144</volume><fpage>1188</fpage><lpage>1194</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">7515558</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>